    "title": "Stick Hero: Tower Defense",
    "description": "<b> Stick Hero: Tower Defense </b> is the best action for Hero Tower games and fighting strategy game on Google Play.\r\n\r\nAre you ready to be the last hero standing in the top battles? Your duty is to charge power: grow as a warrior and defeat horror well-armed enemies and defeat Mighty Boss. Gather your soldiers with a wise strategy and lead them to victory! \r\n\r\n<b> Stick Hero: Tower Defense </b> is a combination of action, strategy, and battle puzzle games. Think before every drag and drop, calculate every move, use your brain to strategize your next action to overcome countless obstacles.\r\n\r\n\u2b50 GAMEPLAY\r\n- Strategy role-playing game\r\n- Move wisely to power up, collect the loot, kill the giant boss and save the princess\r\n- Ways to develop mighty heroes: level up, upgrade skills, merge them to others, turn them into legends\r\n- Become a legend and build your own land\r\n\r\n\u2b50 FEATURE \r\n- Infinite number of levels to challenge\r\n- Attractive and classic red & blue theme\r\n- Heaps of unlockable weapon\r\n- Fast-paced innovative battle system. Real strategy and tactics!\r\n\r\nFeeling thrilled? Excited? Come and join the tower battle in <b> Stick Hero: Tower Defense </b>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b> Stick Hero: Tower Defense </b> is the best action for Hero Tower games and fighting strategy game on Google Play.<br><br>Are you ready to be the last hero standing in the top battles? Your duty is to charge power: grow as a warrior and defeat horror well-armed enemies and defeat Mighty Boss. Gather your soldiers with a wise strategy and lead them to victory! <br><br><b> Stick Hero: Tower Defense </b> is a combination of action, strategy, and battle puzzle games. Think before every drag and drop, calculate every move, use your brain to strategize your next action to overcome countless obstacles.<br><br>\u2b50 GAMEPLAY<br>- Strategy role-playing game<br>- Move wisely to power up, collect the loot, kill the giant boss and save the princess<br>- Ways to develop mighty heroes: level up, upgrade skills, merge them to others, turn them into legends<br>- Become a legend and build your own land<br><br>\u2b50 FEATURE <br>- Infinite number of levels to challenge<br>- Attractive and classic red &amp; blue theme<br>- Heaps of unlockable weapon<br>- Fast-paced innovative battle system. Real strategy and tactics!<br><br>Feeling thrilled? Excited? Come and join the tower battle in <b> Stick Hero: Tower Defense </b>",
